# Image originals and lif-* crops (M1.8): local only, not in git (about 135 MB). manifest.json
# stays committed: the catalog mapping and the unit/rules/repository tests read it. On a fresh
# clone, copy assets/images/ in from a machine that has it, then run `npm run images:build`.
/assets/**
!/assets/images/
!/assets/images/manifest.json
